Fucking knew that was going to happen.

4475
03:47:28,580 --> 03:47:29,120
Blow everything.

4476
03:47:36,710 --> 03:47:38,150
Nice, nice, nice, nice.

4477
03:47:39,010 --> 03:47:40,150
More worm pheromone.

4478
03:47:40,290 --> 03:47:41,010
I'll take it.

4479
03:47:43,210 --> 03:47:43,830
What the hell happened here?

4480
03:47:47,610 --> 03:47:49,090
