Now this one up here, the way to get in there is to go...

4550
03:52:26,020 --> 03:52:27,360
from this side.

4551
03:52:29,740 --> 03:52:30,240
Wait a minute.

4552
03:52:31,040 --> 03:52:32,640
Did I miss the little access hatch?

4553
03:52:33,060 --> 03:52:33,640
Oh, I didn't.

4554
03:52:33,960 --> 03:52:34,920
But we can get through here.

4555
03:52:42,030 --> 03:52:42,250
Perfect.

4556
