No more space.

4557
03:52:46,910 --> 03:52:48,390
Let's get rid of the worm.

4558
03:52:51,090 --> 03:52:52,190
What is going on there?

4559
03:52:55,530 --> 03:52:56,270
What is that?

4560
03:52:57,690 --> 03:52:58,310
It's wood.

4561
03:52:58,690 --> 03:52:59,670
It's weirdly vibrating.

4562
03:53:00,750 --> 03:53:02,130
Probably a physics error.

4563
