4570
03:53:34,180 --> 03:53:36,000
Ah, I can... Oh, I can dig.

4571
03:53:37,180 --> 03:53:39,940
Maybe not very optimally, but it'll work.

4572
03:53:40,800 --> 03:53:41,240
And a pinch.

4573
03:53:41,620 --> 03:53:41,900
Let's go.

4574
03:53:43,960 --> 03:53:44,360
Sweet.

4575
03:53:47,800 --> 03:53:48,580
Alright, I'm excited.

4576
03:53:48,740 --> 03:53:49,300
Let's see what we got.

4577
03:53:50,360 --> 03:53:51,400
Wow, that one looks weird.

4578
03:53:52,160 --> 03:53:53,000
Look at the design on that.

4579
03:53:53,100 --> 03:53:53,840
It's like a...

4580
03:53:56,240 --> 03:53:57,040
knuckle thingies.

4581
03:53:58,080 --> 03:53:58,860
I used to punch people.

4582
03:54:00,340 --> 03:54:02,220
Now, that is the luminous drill.

4583
03:54:03,820 --> 03:54:04,840
That's a lot of bombs.

4584
03:54:06,500 --> 03:54:07,500
A question mark?

4585
03:54:09,040 --> 03:54:10,500
And a saw blade thingy.

4586
03:54:11,920 --> 03:54:12,800
Let's see what we got.

4587
03:54:13,420 --> 03:54:15,740
Why does it keep opening my spells when I go here?

4588
03:54:16,840 --> 03:54:17,180
Explosion immunity?

4589
03:54:19,840 --> 03:54:20,940
Extra wand capacity?

4590
03:54:21,600 --> 03:54:22,120
Extra life?

4591
03:54:22,260 --> 03:54:22,800
Oh my god.

4592
03:54:24,160 --> 03:54:27,040
I'm having a hard time choosing between that and that.

4593
03:54:28,440 --> 03:54:32,580
I feel like this one is very nice to have.

4594
03:54:34,900 --> 03:54:38,500
But that one is also really nice to have.

4595
03:54:39,920 --> 03:54:42,760
Ah, this one is going to serve me longer, I think.

4596
03:54:43,600 --> 03:54:44,600
I'm taking explosion immunity.

4597
03:54:45,760 --> 03:54:46,620
It seems too good.

4598
03:54:50,460 --> 03:54:51,560
Now, what do I want here?

4599
03:54:53,380 --> 03:54:56,760
Because I don't really have any wands that do any damage.

4600
03:55:00,150 --> 03:55:02,070
In fact, all of this is kind of crap.

4601
