Like the spell, I mean.

4603
03:55:09,390 --> 03:55:09,690
Fire?

4604
03:55:09,870 --> 03:55:10,090
Is that?

4605
03:55:10,670 --> 03:55:11,050
Hold on.

4606
03:55:11,510 --> 03:55:13,690
Oh, these are just fire bolts with a question mark?

4607
03:55:13,710 --> 03:55:15,210
I forgot what that question mark means.

4608
03:55:17,330 --> 03:55:19,390
It's actually a lot of damage it deals, but it is limited.

4609
03:55:20,430 --> 03:55:21,230
That's the thing.

4610
03:55:24,150 --> 03:55:25,690
Hmm, I don't like any of this.

4611
03:55:26,570 --> 03:55:27,590
This is terrible.

4612
03:55:32,030 --> 03:55:32,430
But...

4613
03:55:32,430 --> 03:55:33,450
I think this is the best.

4614
03:55:35,630 --> 03:55:36,670
Let's grab that.

4615
03:55:40,440 --> 03:55:40,920
Oh!

4616
03:55:41,100 --> 03:55:42,560
She thought it was the small one!

4617
03:55:43,400 --> 03:55:45,140
Oh, that scared me!

4618
03:55:47,700 --> 03:55:49,580
Oh my god, I just saw death.

4619
03:55:51,660 --> 03:55:52,140
Nope!

4620
03:55:52,140 --> 03:55:54,060
I thought it was the small one!

4621
03:55:55,480 --> 03:55:56,120
Dang it!

4622
03:55:56,800 --> 03:55:57,220
Okay.

4623
03:55:58,300 --> 03:56:00,020
We're definitely not taking that one.

4624
03:56:03,280 --> 03:56:04,980
What do I want to use instead?

4625
03:56:05,640 --> 03:56:06,720
Maybe just fill it up with these.

4626
03:56:07,500 --> 03:56:09,180
That could probably get me through one level.

4627
03:56:09,320 --> 03:56:10,460
That's what I'm thinking.

4628
03:56:10,980 --> 03:56:12,540
Oh, I can't even buy this one!

4629
03:56:12,620 --> 03:56:13,300
I don't have enough money!

4630
03:56:14,220 --> 03:56:15,040
Oh no.

4631
03:56:17,180 --> 03:56:18,200
I have nothing.

4632
03:56:19,780 --> 03:56:20,800
I have nothing!

4633
03:56:22,060 --> 03:56:23,140
This is the worst!

4634
03:56:24,020 --> 03:56:27,280
Then again, it is just the second level.

4635
03:56:27,940 --> 03:56:29,200
It's not the end of the world.

4636
