You know?

4639
03:56:45,240 --> 03:56:45,940
I should.

4640
03:56:46,860 --> 03:56:47,260
You know what?

4641
03:56:48,260 --> 03:56:49,600
Better safe than sorry, right?

4642
03:56:50,380 --> 03:56:53,320
Because I can save my health stuff forever.

4643
03:56:54,780 --> 03:56:56,780
But if I die, it doesn't do anything.

4644
03:56:57,520 --> 03:56:58,880
So, let's play it safe.

4645
03:56:59,560 --> 03:57:00,900
Let's do the smart play here.

4646
03:57:01,740 --> 03:57:02,240
And heal up.

4647
03:57:03,260 --> 03:57:06,000
Now the bouncing burst, I mean...

4648
03:57:09,230 --> 03:57:11,230
I don't want to take that spell refresher yet.

4649
03:57:12,390 --> 03:57:12,950
Or do I?

4650
03:57:13,510 --> 03:57:14,830
Actually, I'll take it.

4651
03:57:15,710 --> 03:57:17,030
I will take it.

4652
03:57:17,930 --> 03:57:18,910
Because let's play it safe, right?

4653
03:57:19,130 --> 03:57:19,810
Like I just said.

4654
03:57:20,950 --> 03:57:22,730
Good news is, we have explosion immunity.

4655
03:57:28,930 --> 03:57:29,230
Okay?

4656
03:57:31,230 --> 03:57:31,910
Let's go!

4657
