The coal pits.

4658
03:57:38,340 --> 03:57:40,600
Now the damage I'm going to be using here is...

4659
03:57:40,600 --> 03:57:42,520
I guess that one, which is not great.

4660
03:57:43,240 --> 03:57:45,080
It smells like soil in here?

4661
03:57:45,200 --> 03:57:45,740
What did it say?

4662
03:57:47,240 --> 03:57:48,800
I didn't manage to read that in time.

4663
03:57:52,350 --> 03:57:53,790
Can I want to set fire to this?

4664
03:57:56,250 --> 03:57:56,970
Is there a secret in there?

4665
03:57:58,570 --> 03:57:58,950
Uh-oh.

4666
03:58:01,230 --> 03:58:01,710
Whoa!

4667
03:58:13,030 --> 03:58:14,570
Oh, this is not good.

4668
03:58:14,730 --> 03:58:15,370
This is not good.

4669
03:58:17,490 --> 03:58:19,790
I'm using my high value once here.

4670
03:58:21,890 --> 03:58:23,690
Oh, I want that so bad.

4671
03:58:24,730 --> 03:58:26,350
I can definitely get it though, right?

4672
03:58:27,570 --> 03:58:28,130
Oh yeah.

4673
03:58:29,070 --> 03:58:30,390
And then we do this.

4674
03:58:34,110 --> 03:58:35,550
That's definitely doing something.

4675
03:58:41,250 --> 03:58:42,230
It's not a lot though.

4676
03:58:43,630 --> 03:58:44,210
There we go.

4677
03:58:45,150 --> 03:58:45,290
Please.

4678
03:58:48,350 --> 03:58:49,250
Short range homing!

4679
03:58:51,350 --> 03:58:52,250
Not bad.

4680
03:58:53,330 --> 03:58:54,210
Remove explosion?

4681
03:58:55,090 --> 03:58:56,630
Makes the projectile no longer explode.

4682
03:58:58,110 --> 03:58:58,250
Huh.

4683
03:59:00,390 --> 03:59:00,770
Okay.

4684
03:59:02,050 --> 03:59:02,970
Maybe I will take this.

4685
03:59:04,950 --> 03:59:06,290
Let's actually try it.

4686
03:59:10,600 --> 03:59:11,560
What is the point of these again?

4687
03:59:12,100 --> 03:59:17,360
Summons an otherwise empty egg that casts a spell upon cracking open.

4688
03:59:19,700 --> 03:59:21,120
I don't understand this one.

4689
